      'Full-stack DNS deliverability & spoofing risk scorecard',
      'Root SPF mechanism validation & 10-lookup limit audit',
      'Authoritative DMARC policy check (p=quarantine / p=reject)',
      'DKIM selector probing & syntax validation',
